{"seq":1,"slug":"order-routing-decision-model","title":"订单路由决策模型与候选供应商选择（成本/时效/库存/评分多目标）","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/dropship-supplier-direct-fulfillment-engineering/order-routing-blind-fulfillment/order-routing-decision-model","wordCount":3069,"readingTime":13,"html":"<h1 id=\"订单路由决策模型与候选供应商选择-成本-时效-库存-评分多目标\">订单路由决策模型与候选供应商选择（成本/时效/库存/评分多目标）</h1><p>一件代发的路由问题和自营仓配的根本区别在于：卖家不拥有履约节点，节点是外部供应商，其价格、时效、库存、可靠性每时每刻都在变，同一个 SKU 往往同时挂在三五个供应商上。于是「这单发给谁」不再是查表，而是一次多目标决策——要在成本、时效、库存确定性、供应商历史评分之间选一个当下最优、事后还能解释的答案。本文拆解这个模型的构造：候选集怎么定、多目标怎么合成分数、硬约束与软偏好如何分层、拆单代价怎么算，以及评分如何可复现。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念-路由决策的输入输出边界\">核心概念：路由决策的输入输出边界</h2><p>路由器的输入是一份<strong>订单行集合</strong>（行含 SKU、数量、收货地址、市场）加一份<strong>候选供应关系表</strong>（供应商 × SKU 的价格、可售量、承诺出库时效、历史履约指标），输出是<strong>一个或多个 (供应商, 行子集) 分配</strong>。输出不一定是单点——没有供应商能覆盖全部行时，输出就是拆单。\n这个「分配」在平台侧有明确的落地形态。Shopify 把「同一位置履约的订单行」聚合成 <code>FulfillmentOrder</code> 对象，官方定义是「expected to be fulfilled from the same location」（来源：<a href=\"https://shopify.dev/docs/api/admin-graphql/latest/objects/FulfillmentOrder）。它由平台的**后台路由过程**在订单创建后自动生成，文档明确说「It\">https://shopify.dev/docs/api/admin-graphql/latest/objects/FulfillmentOrder）。它由平台的**后台路由过程**在订单创建后自动生成，文档明确说「It</a> is not possible to manually create fulfillment orders」——外部只能通过 <code>fulfillmentOrderMove</code> 改派或 <code>fulfillmentOrdersReroute</code> 触发重路由。含义是：路由逻辑若不发生在平台内，就必须发生在你下单给供应商之前的那一层。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;  A[订单行集合&lt;br/&gt;SKU/数量/地址/市场] --&gt; B{候选集构造&lt;br/&gt;硬约束过滤}&#10;  B --&gt;|可行集合| C[多目标评分&lt;br/&gt;归一化+加权]&#10;  C --&gt; D[排序取最优&lt;br/&gt;含 tie-break]&#10;  D --&gt; E{单一供应商&lt;br/&gt;覆盖全部行?}&#10;  E --&gt;|是| F[单点分配]&#10;  E --&gt;|否| G[拆单决策]\">graph TD\n  A[订单行集合&lt;br/&gt;SKU/数量/地址/市场] --&gt; B{候选集构造&lt;br/&gt;硬约束过滤}\n  B --&gt;|可行集合| C[多目标评分&lt;br/&gt;归一化+加权]\n  C --&gt; D[排序取最优&lt;br/&gt;含 tie-break]\n  D --&gt; E{单一供应商&lt;br/&gt;覆盖全部行?}\n  E --&gt;|是| F[单点分配]\n  E --&gt;|否| G[拆单决策]</pre><h2 id=\"候选集构造-用硬约束先把不可行的去掉\">候选集构造：用硬约束先把不可行的去掉</h2><p>多目标打分的第一步不是打分，而是<strong>把不可能变成不在场</strong>。硬约束是「违反即错误」的条件，不参与权衡——数量不足就是不足，加权再高也不能把一个库存为 0 的供应商推到第一。代发场景的硬约束至少四类：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>约束类别</th>\n<th>判定条件</th>\n<th>违反后果</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>库存可行性</td>\n<td>供应商可售量 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>≥</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\ge</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7719em;vertical-align:-0.136em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≥</span></span></span></span></span> 行需求量</td>\n<td>超卖、取消订单</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>履约地域</td>\n<td>供应商可发往收货国，不涉禁运/合规限制</td>\n<td>无法清关、退回</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>能力匹配</td>\n<td>支持该品类（带电、液体、定制、危险品）</td>\n<td>拒单或违规发运</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>渠道/账期</td>\n<td>可对接你的下单通道，额度未超</td>\n<td>下单失败</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>这四类都是布尔过滤，任何一种失败都直接把供应商剔除。平台侧的同类机制是 Shopify 的 <strong>Fulfillment Constraints Function API</strong>（版本 <code>2026-10</code>），只提供两个操作：<code>deliverableLinesMustFulfillFromAdd</code>（强制某些行从指定位置列表发货）和 <code>deliverableLinesMustFulfillFromSameLocationAdd</code>（强制某些行从同一位置发货）（来源：<a href=\"https://shopify.dev/docs/api/functions/latest/fulfillment-constraints）。文档警告，当约束冲突或库存不可用时「checkout\">https://shopify.dev/docs/api/functions/latest/fulfillment-constraints）。文档警告，当约束冲突或库存不可用时「checkout</a> won&#39;t return any shipping rates」——硬约束失败不是降级，而是整笔交易阻断。含义是：<strong>硬约束必须尽量宽进、层内可解释</strong>，把真正致命的和只是「不太好」的分开，否则一次错误配置就会挡住全站下单。过滤后还需<strong>去重与同源合并</strong>：同一实物供应商在多个渠道（AliExpress 店、1688 店、独立站）可能是三条供货记录，不去重则评分阶段看到三个「近似并列」的候选。DSers 用「country-based supplier selection」加多供应商货源与备用供应商把同一 SKU 的多个货源显式建模（来源：<a href=\"https://www.dsers.com/）。##\">https://www.dsers.com/）。##</a> 多目标归一化与加权和评分</p>\n<p>候选集确定后，每个候选在若干目标上有一个原始值。这些目标的量纲完全不同：成本是货币、时效是天数、库存是件数、评分无量纲。直接相加没有意义，必须先归一化。对「越小越好」的成本类目标 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>j</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">j</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.854em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0572em;\">j</span></span></span></span></span>，最小-最大归一化写作：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>s</mi><mrow><mi>i</mi><mi>j</mi></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><msubsup><mi>x</mi><mi>j</mi><mi>max</mi><mo>⁡</mo></msubsup><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>x</mi><mrow><mi>i</mi><mi>j</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><mrow><msubsup><mi>x</mi><mi>j</mi><mi>max</mi><mo>⁡</mo></msubsup><mo>−</mo><msubsup><mi>x</mi><mi>j</mi><mi>min</mi><mo>⁡</mo></msubsup></mrow></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">s_{ij} = \\frac{x_j^{\\max} - x_{ij}}{x_j^{\\max} - x_j^{\\min}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7167em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0572em;\">ij</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.5644em;vertical-align:-1.1153em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.4492em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.2977em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6462em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4231em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0572em;\">j</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.0448em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mop mtight\"><span class=\"mtight\">m</span><span class=\"mtight\">a</span><span class=\"mtight\">x</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.413em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8123em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4231em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0572em;\">j</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.0448em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mop mtight\"><span class=\"mtight\">m</span><span class=\"mtight\">i</span><span class=\"mtight\">n</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.413em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.7848em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6644em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4413em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0572em;\">j</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mop mtight\"><span class=\"mtight\">m</span><span class=\"mtight\">a</span><span class=\"mtight\">x</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3948em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0572em;\">ij</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.1153em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>x</mi><mrow><mi>i</mi><mi>j</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">x_{ij}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7167em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0572em;\">ij</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是候选 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>i</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6595em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">i</span></span></span></span></span> 在目标 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>j</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">j</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.854em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0572em;\">j</span></span></span></span></span> 上的原始值，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msubsup><mi>x</mi><mi>j</mi><mi>max</mi><mo>⁡</mo></msubsup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">x_j^{\\max}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0592em;vertical-align:-0.3948em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6644em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4413em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0572em;\">j</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mop mtight\"><span class=\"mtight\">m</span><span class=\"mtight\">a</span><span class=\"mtight\">x</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3948em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>、<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msubsup><mi>x</mi><mi>j</mi><mi>min</mi><mo>⁡</mo></msubsup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">x_j^{\\min}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.2253em;vertical-align:-0.3948em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8305em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4413em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0572em;\">j</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mop mtight\"><span class=\"mtight\">m</span><span class=\"mtight\">i</span><span class=\"mtight\">n</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3948em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是候选集内该目标的最大最小值。归一化后 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>s</mi><mrow><mi>i</mi><mi>j</mi></mrow></msub><mo>∈</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">[</mo><mn>0</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">]</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">s_{ij} \\in [0,1]</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8252em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0572em;\">ij</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">∈</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">[</span><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mclose\">]</span></span></span></span></span>，越大越好。时效、评分同理；库存类可用「可覆盖需求倍数」<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><mi>min</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mtext>demand</mtext><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mtext>available</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">1 - \\min(1, \\text{demand}/\\text{available})</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\">min</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">demand</span></span><span class=\"mord\">/</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">available</span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 压到 [0,1]。合成用<strong>加性加权和</strong>：最大化 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi mathvariant=\"bold\">w</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">⊤</mi></msup><mi mathvariant=\"bold\">q</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\mathbf{w}^\\top \\mathbf{q}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0435em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathbf\" style=\"margin-right:0.016em;\">w</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8491em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">⊤</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord mathbf\">q</span></span></span></span></span>，其中权重 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"bold\">w</mi><mo>&gt;</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\mathbf{w} &gt; 0</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5782em;vertical-align:-0.0391em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathbf\" style=\"margin-right:0.016em;\">w</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&gt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0</span></span></span></span></span>（来源：Wikipedia「Multiple-criteria decision analysis」，<a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Multiple-criteria_decision_analysis）。这是\">https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Multiple-criteria_decision_analysis）。这是</a> MCDA（多准则决策分析）里最基本的形式，优点是可毫秒级算完、每一项都能追根溯源，缺点是只能到达<strong>凸有效解</strong>，无法触达所有帕累托最优点。对路由这种每秒决策上万次的场景，这个取舍值得：可解释性优先于理论完备。</p>\n<p>一个代发路由的实际权重形态大致如下：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>目标</th>\n<th>方向</th>\n<th>归一化方式</th>\n<th>典型权重</th>\n<th>数据来源</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>落地总成本（货价+运费+关税）</td>\n<td>越小越好</td>\n<td>min-max</td>\n<td>0.30–0.45</td>\n<td>价目表、运费模板</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>承诺出库时效</td>\n<td>越小越好</td>\n<td>min-max</td>\n<td>0.20–0.30</td>\n<td>供应商 SLA</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>库存确定性</td>\n<td>越大越好</td>\n<td>覆盖倍数压缩</td>\n<td>0.15–0.25</td>\n<td>实时同步的可售量</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>供应商历史评分</td>\n<td>越大越好</td>\n<td>已是 [0,1]</td>\n<td>0.10–0.20</td>\n<td>及时率、纠纷率</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>拆单惩罚</td>\n<td>越小越好</td>\n<td>计数型</td>\n<td>常数扣减</td>\n<td>本单分配结构</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>权重不是永恒的：促销期时效权重应上升、成本权重可下降；高价值订单的库存确定性权重应上升。权重必须<strong>版本化</strong>并随决策落库，否则同一笔订单事后无法重现排序。</p>\n<h2 id=\"硬约束与软偏好的分层决策\">硬约束与软偏好的分层决策</h2><p>把「加权」和「过滤」混在一起是路由模型最常见的错误。正确结构是<strong>两阶段</strong>：先硬约束过滤得到可行集 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"script\">F</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\mathcal{F}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathcal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0993em;\">F</span></span></span></span></span>，再在 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"script\">F</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\mathcal{F}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathcal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0993em;\">F</span></span></span></span></span> 上做加权排序：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>i</mi><mo lspace=\"0em\" rspace=\"0em\">∗</mo></msup><mo>=</mo><mi>arg</mi><mo>⁡</mo><munder><mrow><mi>max</mi><mo>⁡</mo></mrow><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>∈</mo><mi mathvariant=\"script\">F</mi></mrow></munder><munder><mo>∑</mo><mi>j</mi></munder><msub><mi>w</mi><mi>j</mi></msub><msub><mi>s</mi><mrow><mi>i</mi><mi>j</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">i^{*} = \\arg\\max_{i \\in \\mathcal{F}} \\sum_{j} w_j s_{ij}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7387em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">i</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.7387em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.113em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">∗</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.4638em;vertical-align:-1.4138em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\">ar<span style=\"margin-right:0.0139em;\">g</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mop op-limits\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.3557em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span><span class=\"mrel mtight\">∈</span><span class=\"mord mathcal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0993em;\">F</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span><span class=\"mop\">max</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.7717em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mop op-limits\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.05em;\"><span style=\"top:-1.8723em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0572em;\">j</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span><span class=\"mop op-symbol large-op\">∑</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.4138em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0269em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0572em;\">j</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0572em;\">ij</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>这样权重再离谱也不会选出一个库存为 0 的供应商——它根本不在 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"script\">F</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\mathcal{F}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathcal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0993em;\">F</span></span></span></span></span> 里。软偏好只在可行集内起作用。</p>\n<p>平台侧也遵循同样的分层。Shopify 默认路由规则按顺序依次执行，用三条规则对位置排序：优先能覆盖全部订单行的位置（Minimize split fulfillments）、优先订单目的市场内的位置、然后选距离最近的位置（来源：<a href=\"https://help.shopify.com/en/manual/fulfillment/setup/order-routing/routing-rules）。这三条本质上是「硬约束（能覆盖）＋\">https://help.shopify.com/en/manual/fulfillment/setup/order-routing/routing-rules）。这三条本质上是「硬约束（能覆盖）＋</a> 两级软偏好（市场、距离）」，且是<strong>字典序</strong>而非加权——先严格满足第一条，只有第一条并列时才看第二条。自定义规则可引入位置 metafield（仓库产能、履约速度）来优先特定仓库、平衡库存或压低成本；自定义 order-routing location rules 仅对 Shopify Plus 商家开放（来源：<a href=\"https://shopify.dev/docs/apps/build/orders-fulfillment/order-routing-apps）。\">https://shopify.dev/docs/apps/build/orders-fulfillment/order-routing-apps）。</a></p>\n<p>对代发中间件来说，字典序和加权各有适用面：<strong>安全类条件用字典序</strong>（如「供应商不得处于风控黑名单」必须排在一切之前），<strong>经济类条件用加权</strong>（成本和时效之间存在可交换的比例关系）。用字典序处理经济目标会导致「为便宜 0.5 元而多等 3 天」这类极端结果，因为字典序没有交换率概念。</p>\n<h2 id=\"拆单决策的代价模型\">拆单决策的代价模型</h2><p>当没有单一供应商能覆盖全部订单行时，问题从「选择」变成「组合」。设每个行 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>k</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">k</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span></span> 有一个可行供应商集合 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi mathvariant=\"script\">F</mi><mi>k</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\mathcal{F}_k</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathcal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0993em;\">F</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0993em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>，目标是找一组分配把行覆盖完且最小化总代价。引入指示变量 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>z</mi><mrow><mi>i</mi><mi>k</mi></mrow></msub><mo>∈</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">{</mo><mn>0</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">}</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">z_{ik} \\in \\{0,1\\}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6891em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.044em;\">z</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.044em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">ik</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">∈</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">{</span><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mclose\">}</span></span></span></span></span> 表示行 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>k</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">k</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span></span> 由供应商 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>i</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6595em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">i</span></span></span></span></span> 承担：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>min</mi><mo>⁡</mo><munder><mo>∑</mo><mi>i</mi></munder><munder><mo>∑</mo><mi>k</mi></munder><msub><mi>c</mi><mrow><mi>i</mi><mi>k</mi></mrow></msub><msub><mi>z</mi><mrow><mi>i</mi><mi>k</mi></mrow></msub><mo>+</mo><munder><mo>∑</mo><mi>i</mi></munder><msub><mi>f</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>⋅</mo><mn mathvariant=\"double-struck\">1</mn><mtext> ⁣</mtext><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">[</mo><munder><mo>∑</mo><mi>k</mi></munder><msub><mi>z</mi><mrow><mi>i</mi><mi>k</mi></mrow></msub><mo>&gt;</mo><mn>0</mn><mo fence=\"true\">]</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\min \\sum_{i}\\sum_{k} c_{ik} z_{ik} + \\sum_{i} f_i \\cdot \\mathbb{1}\\!\\left[\\sum_k z_{ik} &gt; 0\\right]</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.3521em;vertical-align:-1.3021em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\">min</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mop op-limits\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.05em;\"><span style=\"top:-1.8723em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span><span class=\"mop op-symbol large-op\">∑</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.2777em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mop op-limits\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.05em;\"><span style=\"top:-1.8479em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span><span class=\"mop op-symbol large-op\">∑</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3021em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">ik</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.044em;\">z</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.044em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">ik</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.3277em;vertical-align:-1.2777em;\"></span><span class=\"mop op-limits\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.05em;\"><span style=\"top:-1.8723em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span><span class=\"mop op-symbol large-op\">∑</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.2777em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1076em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:3.0521em;vertical-align:-1.3021em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:-0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"mopen delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\"><span class=\"delimsizing size4\">[</span></span><span class=\"mop op-limits\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.05em;\"><span style=\"top:-1.8479em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span><span class=\"mop op-symbol large-op\">∑</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3021em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.044em;\">z</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.044em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">ik</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&gt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"mclose delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\"><span class=\"delimsizing size4\">]</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>c</mi><mrow><mi>i</mi><mi>k</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">c_{ik}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">ik</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是行 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>k</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">k</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span></span> 走供应商 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>i</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6595em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">i</span></span></span></span></span> 的归一化代价，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>f</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">f_i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1076em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是「启用供应商 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>i</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6595em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">i</span></span></span></span></span>」的固定代价——固定项是拆单惩罚的核心，对应每次多一个包裹的真实成本：一笔头程或末端运费、一次买家追踪体验劣化、多一个退货地址、多一次清关主体。量级参考：2025 年美国线上退货占线上销售额的 19.3%（来源：NRF 与 Happy Returns，转引自 dropship.io，<a href=\"https://www.dropship.io/blog/dropshipping-statistics）。\">https://www.dropship.io/blog/dropshipping-statistics）。</a></p>\n<p>整笔订单在多供应商下的搜索空间随行数指数增长，实务上用<strong>贪心 + 局部改进</strong>：先按加权分选最优供应商，把能覆盖的行都分给它，剩余行递归处理；再尝试把某个已分配行挪到其他供应商，看能否消掉一个包裹。它不保证全局最优，但在行数通常不超过 10 的代发订单里够用，且每一步都可解释——这对客服追问「为什么拆成两个包裹」至关重要。一个必须显式处理的边界是<strong>部分覆盖</strong>：如果某些行连一个可行供应商都没有（全部缺货），路由器不能静默丢弃，而应把这些行标记为「不可路由」并触发降级路径——延期履约、替换 SKU、或人工介入。这与库存同步里的超卖窗口是同一问题的两种表现：路由层缺货与同步层过期，都会在买家侧呈现为「下单后取消」。</p>\n<h2 id=\"评分的可复现性与治理\">评分的可复现性与治理</h2><p>一个多次运行同一订单却算出不同供应商的路由器不可运营。可复现性取决于三件事：<strong>权重版本固定、输入快照固定、tie-break 确定</strong>。权重落库已在前文说明；输入快照指参与评分的库存与价格必须带时间戳，取路由时刻值而非现查值；tie-break 必须是全序——两个候选加权分完全相等时，用一个稳定键（如供应商 ID 字典序）打破，绝不允许依赖哈希表遍历顺序。</p>\n<p>可复现性同时是<strong>纠纷追溯</strong>的前提。当买家投诉「同一件商品我朋友买更便宜却更慢」，运营需要拉出这两笔订单当时的候选集、权重版本、各目标原始值和最终分数。这要求决策日志至少包含：订单 ID、候选供应商列表、各目标原始值与归一化值、权重版本 ID、最终选择与理由码。理由码把决策压成可统计的类别——「成本最优」「时效最优」「唯一可行」「拆单合并」——让路由质量可度量：「唯一可行」占比持续走高说明候选集太窄，是补货或拓源的信号。</p>\n<p>权重治理则要防两类退化：<strong>权重僵化</strong>（业务已从拼时效转向拼成本，路由仍按旧偏好选贵的）与<strong>权重漂移</strong>（为短期指标反复微调，导致决策不可比）。可行约束是把权重当配置资产纳入版本控制，每次变更走一次评审，并保留旧版本用于回放——用历史订单在新旧权重下各跑一遍，比较「按新权重要多花多少钱、快多少天」，用数字而非直觉决定上线。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><p>一次可运营的路由决策，是把四个环节串成一条可解释、可回放的链路：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>候选集构造</strong>用硬约束（库存、地域、能力、账期）布尔过滤，先排除不可行项，避免加权掩盖致命缺陷。</li>\n<li><strong>多目标评分</strong>对各目标归一化后加性加权，权重版本化随决策落库，软偏好只在可行集内起作用。</li>\n<li><strong>分层决策</strong>用字典序处理安全类条件、用加权处理经济类条件，避免没有交换率的极端选择。</li>\n<li><strong>拆单与治理</strong>把每个额外部件的固定代价显式建模，用理由码与回放把决策变成可度量的资产。\n上游依赖候选集数据质量，见<a href=\"../inventory-price-sync/inventory-realtime-sync-model\">库存实时同步模型与一致性语义</a>；下游见<a href=\"blind-ship-fulfillment-pipeline\">盲发履约管道与面单回传</a>。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"订单路由决策模型与候选供应商选择（成本/时效/库存/评分多目标）","id":"订单路由决策模型与候选供应商选择-成本-时效-库存-评分多目标"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念：路由决策的输入输出边界","id":"核心概念-路由决策的输入输出边界"},{"level":2,"text":"候选集构造：用硬约束先把不可行的去掉","id":"候选集构造-用硬约束先把不可行的去掉"},{"level":2,"text":"硬约束与软偏好的分层决策","id":"硬约束与软偏好的分层决策"},{"level":2,"text":"拆单决策的代价模型","id":"拆单决策的代价模型"},{"level":2,"text":"评分的可复现性与治理","id":"评分的可复现性与治理"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"超卖防控、断货降级与库存漂移对账修复","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/dropship-supplier-direct-fulfillment-engineering/inventory-price-sync/oversell-prevention-drift-reconciliation"},"next":{"title":"盲发履约管道：单据下发、面单回传与轨迹回写（无品牌标识与面单合规）","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/dropship-supplier-direct-fulfillment-engineering/order-routing-blind-fulfillment/blind-ship-fulfillment-pipeline"}}